      "writtenOn": "2019-10-25T19:18:25Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "On start up, we set it\u0027s explicitly DISABLED (a.k.a. Clamshell). Then, the mode goes between ENABLED and DISABLED. When do we need UNINITIALIZED or UNSET? The mode is always set. \n\nEven a tablet device can start as a Clamshell and switch to tablet. Hooks and OS will be notified.",
      "parentUuid": "abcabf8e_5590a7f4",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 42,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 42,
        "endChar": 30
      },
